# docs/FINAL_ARCHITECTURE.md

# Final Architecture

## 插件层级

```text
DTALEX Codex Integrated Plugin
├── Context Keeper
│   ├── context_pack_builder.py
│   └── long-term memory docs
├── Project Guardian
│   ├── project_guard.py
│   └── AI pollution guard
├── Fast Safe Coder
│   ├── changed_file_gate.py
│   └── small patch workflow
├── Architecture Guard
│   ├── architecture_guard.py
│   └── module boundary checks
├── Quality Gate
│   ├── optional code-guardian integration
│   └── format/lint/type/security
├── Swarm Lite
│   └── safe multi-agent file ownership
└── Commercial Code Standard
    ├── Definition of Done
    └── Code Review Checklist
```

## 三个来源项目的最终处理

| 来源 | 处理 | 说明 |
|---|---|---|
| Knowledge-Base | 吸收治理经验 | AI污染防火墙、Context Pack、TaskPack、A/B/C线边界 |
| Skill-Integration | 吸收技能思想 | swarm-dev 改成 Swarm Lite；code-guardian 改成 Quality Gate |
| AI-Enhancement-Package | 吸收运维规则 | AGENTS、插件核验、Token节省、长期记忆、启动流程 |

## A/B/C 线

```text
A线：人的学习系统
B线：机器知识与任务辅助
C线：Codex开发治理系统
```

本插件属于 C 线。


