# docs/INSTALL_QUICK_START.md

# Quick Start

## 1. 安装为全局 Codex Skills

```powershell
cd DTALEX_Codex_Integrated_Plugin_vFinal
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\install_to_codex.ps1
```

## 2. 安装到项目

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\install_to_project.ps1 -ProjectRoot "D:\YourProject"
```

## 3. 给项目放 AGENTS 模板

```powershell
Copy-Item .\templates\AGENTS_DTALEX_GLOBAL.md "D:\YourProject\AGENTS.md"
```

## 4. 运行检查

```powershell
cd D:\YourProject
python .codex\plugins\dtalex-guardian\scripts\project_guard.py --root . --fail-on error
python .codex\plugins\dtalex-guardian\scripts\changed_file_gate.py --root . --max-files 12
python .codex\plugins\dtalex-guardian\scripts\architecture_guard.py --root .
```

## 5. 生成上下文包

```powershell
python .codex\plugins\dtalex-guardian\scripts\context_pack_builder.py --root . --out outputs/context_pack.md
```

## 6. 生成任务包

```powershell
python .codex\plugins\dtalex-guardian\scripts\taskpack_builder.py --root . --goal "精简项目并保留未来路线" --out outputs/taskpack.md
```


