# docs/USAGE.md

# Usage

## Start a new repo

```text
Use dtalex-context-keeper to build a context pack.
Use dtalex-project-guardian to scan for pollution.
Use dtalex-swarm-lite only after scope is clear.
Use dtalex-quality-gate before accepting changes.
```

## Clean an AI-polluted repo

```bash
python .codex/plugins/dtalex-guardian/scripts/project_guard.py --root . --fail-on never
```

Read:

```text
outputs/guardian_report.md
outputs/guardian_report.json
```

Fix error-level findings first.

## Generate task pack

```bash
python .codex/plugins/dtalex-guardian/scripts/taskpack_builder.py --root . --goal "simplify project" --out outputs/taskpack.md
```


