# docs/INTEGRATE_WITH_KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md

# Integrate with Knowledge-Base

## Use this plugin as C-line

```text
A-line: human learning
B-line: machine knowledge / task assistance
C-line: Codex governance / AI pollution guard
```

## What to copy into Knowledge-Base

Copy only:

```text
scripts/project_guard.py
scripts/run_project_guard.ps1
.github/workflows/project-guardian.yml
docs/CODEX_WORKFLOW.md
```

Do not copy the entire plugin into backend/frontend source.

## Recommended Knowledge-Base flow

```text
docs/00_CURRENT_SCOPE.md
→ context pack
→ taskpack
→ small CODEX change
→ project_guard
→ tests
→ lessons learned
```


